      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The 403 issue will be worked around in the upcoming yt-dlp release by adding `web_embedded` to fallback clients (if `android_vr` fails), the last remaining client extractor with legacy format 18 without login.\n\nhttps://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/pull/17462\n\nIt'll be prone to breakage, because it relies on a JS runtime to solve challenges.",
